{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A groundbreaking real-time grand strategy game with limitless armies, endless cities, and unparalleled resource simulation. Built to redefine wargames and push the boundaries of scale and depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/dss2_zoom_to_battle_gif_anim.gif?t=1744797251\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">City Building: Construct and develop your cities to support your war efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defenses: Turtle up with fortifications and guard posts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource Management: Set up production chains with a delivery system to ensure a smooth supply of materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate: Setup your medieval industry too keep running while you are busy conquering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Army Controls: Command your forces across the map while keeping them well-supplied and fed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse Military Units: Deploy various unit types, each with its own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diplomacy system: Coerce others into joining your cause.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Incredible scale: Hundreds of thousands of soldiers and workers are simulated in real time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/resource_management_animation_edit.gif?t=1744797251\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New from DSS 1</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three times the amount of resources, buildings and soldiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A skill and level up system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Technology tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free building of walls and fortifications.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new villain introduces horde waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical controls during battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Updated graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New soldier AI that moves to avoid terrain and is more active during battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ambience sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Map editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Lab: Pit soldiers against each other.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582440?t=1744797251","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/08ef5e917c3119def97578597adec8920341bcf1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744797251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/4497c05e23289de8a6b2f47c40786618a6d9657b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744797251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/4497c05e23289de8a6b2f47c40786618a6d9657b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744797251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A groundbreaking real-time grand strategy game with limitless armies, endless cities, and unparalleled resource simulation. Built to redefine wargames and push the boundaries of scale and depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/dss2_zoom_to_battle_gif_anim.gif?t=1744797251\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">City Building: Construct and develop your cities to support your war efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defenses: Turtle up with fortifications and guard posts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource Management: Set up production chains with a delivery system to ensure a smooth supply of materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate: Setup your medieval industry too keep running while you are busy conquering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Army Controls: Command your forces across the map while keeping them well-supplied and fed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse Military Units: Deploy various unit types, each with its own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diplomacy system: Coerce others into joining your cause.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Incredible scale: Hundreds of thousands of soldiers and workers are simulated in real time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/extras/resource_management_animation_edit.gif?t=1744797251\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New from DSS 1</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three times the amount of resources, buildings and soldiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A skill and level up system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Technology tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free building of walls and fortifications.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new villain introduces horde waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical controls during battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Updated graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New soldier AI that moves to avoid terrain and is more active during battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ambience sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Map editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Lab: Pit soldiers against each other.</p></li></ul>","developers":["vikingfabian"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582440/b80ea92dc878ec8504f08691bf4280ae48247550/header.jpg?t=1744797251","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122809,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122809/movie480.mp4?t=1743966304","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122809/movie_max.mp4?t=1743966304"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122809/67771b446c07866c1e71defe68a6a63a1b222317/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743966304","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122809/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743966304","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122809/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743966304"}}],"name":"DSS 2: War Industry","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.2 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128mb Video Memory, capable of Shader Model 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["vikingfabian"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"No